 "id": 175703,
 "name": "Web Content Browser for AI Agents Community Group",
 "is_closed": false,
 "creation-date": "2026-03-24",
 "description": "<p>AI agents increasingly need to read and interact with web pages. The current approach - sending raw HTML or DOM snapshots to language models - is wasteful and lossy. This Community Group will develop a JSON format to represent web page content in a form optimized for consumption by AI agents and language models. One goal is to reduce token costs (through compression) while preserving semantic meaning and interactivity.</p>\n\n<p>Group deliverables are expected to be a specification, schema, conformance test suite, and integration guide. The <a href=\"https://plasmate.app/docs/som-spec\">SOM Spec v1.0</a> is intended to serve as a starting point for discussion within the group, but is not intended to constrain the group's discussions or decisions about future deliverables.</p>\n\n<p>This group will publish Specifications.</p>",
